# Keep the Docker build context to source only. The image installs its own
# (Linux) node_modules in the deps stage and builds .next itself; shipping
# the host copies made `COPY . .` take minutes and, worse, overwrote the
# Linux node_modules with the host's platform-specific one.
node_modules
.next
.git
.github
data
.vercel
.claude
.claude-flow
.agents
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tmp.ts
*.log
docs
